### Deferred findings from Phase B review

**PB-1 — `CircuitAfterGoAround` goal wrong after go-around phase** — DONE (2026-04-22)
`derivePilotGoal` for `CircuitAfterGoAround` now recurses into the active child:
GoAround subtask active → TOUCH_AND_GO; resumed Circuit subtask → ARRIVE.
Previously always returned TOUCH_AND_GO, causing no vacate instruction after landing.

**PB-2 — `isCircuitLike()` and `isLastActiveCircuit` filter used `||` chains** — DONE (2026-04-22)
Both converted to exhaustive `when` expressions so new TaskName variants require a conscious decision.

**PB-3 — `CircuitNotFound` error when circuit leg has empty points** — DONE (2026-04-22)
Changed to `InsufficientGeometry` (circuit exists, geometry data is incomplete).

